     1	"""Per-rover mission FSM.  One `RoverAgent` per rover; the Supervisor owns planning services (`AgentContext`)
     2	and the safety layer.  Every state has an entry condition, a timeout and a failure path; nothing waits forever.
     3	
     4	Task = deliver one cube colour.  A task executes its PushPlan one leg at a time and REPLANS from the observed
     5	cube state after every leg (never executes a stale plan).
     6	
     7	    IDLE -> NAVIGATE -> ALIGN -> CAPTURE -> VERIFY_CAPTURE -> PUSH --(more legs)--> RETREAT -> NAVIGATE ...
     8	                                                             \--(final leg)--> VERIFY_DELIVERY -> RETREAT -> IDLE
     9	    any -> WAIT (reservation denied) | RELOCALIZE (estimate unsafe) | EMERGENCY_STOP (safety layer) | YIELD
    10	    failures -> RETREAT (if a cube may be in the channel) -> REPLAN (bounded retries per cube) -> IDLE (abandon)
    11	"""
