    53	class ReservationTable:
    54	    """Each rover holds at most one reservation: the list of convex polygons (corridor / prepush /
    55	    depot footprints) it currently claims.  `reserve` replaces it wholesale; callers are expected to
    56	    re-reserve (with a shrunk polygon list) as a plan is re-legged, and `trim` releases the part
